        <type>Eigen::Vector3d</type>
        <definition>Eigen::Vector3d Marmot::ContinuumMechanics::Voigt::voigtToPlaneVoigt</definition>
        <argsstring>(const Marmot::Math::Vector6d &amp;voigt)</argsstring>
        <name>voigtToPlaneVoigt</name>
        <qualifiedname>Marmot::ContinuumMechanics::Voigt::voigtToPlaneVoigt</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const Marmot::Math::Vector6d &amp;</type>
          <declname>voigt</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Converts a 3D stress vector in Voigt notation to a plane stress vector. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>voigt</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>6-component 3D stress vector in Voigt notation:     <formula id="146">\[\begin{bmatrix}
\sigma_{11} &amp; \sigma_{22} &amp; \sigma_{33} &amp; \sigma_{12} &amp; \sigma_{13} &amp; \sigma_{23}
\end{bmatrix}^T
\]</formula> where <formula id="147">$\sigma_{33} = \sigma_{13} = \sigma_{23} = 0$</formula> in plane stress conditions. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>3-component plane stress vector in Voigt notation:     <formula id="148">\[\begin{bmatrix}
\sigma_{11} &amp; \sigma_{22} &amp; \sigma_{12}
\end{bmatrix}^T
\]</formula> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>This function extracts only the in-plane components of a 3D stress vector. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
